1
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:13,000
Hello.

2
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:13,680
Four yuan.

3
00:00:23,840 --> 00:00:24,600
What do you mean?

4
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:26,130
You didn't bring any money?

5
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:28,970
I forgot to bring it.

6
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:30,200
You forgot?

7
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:32,640
You ate it

8
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:33,960
and now you're not paying?

9
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:35,120
I'll go home and get the money.

10
00:00:35,120 --> 00:00:36,160
I'll be right back.

11
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:37,240
Go back and get it?

12
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:39,160
You've already eaten half of it,

13
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:41,560
and now you say
you'll go back for the money?

14
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:44,400
If I met dine-and-dashers
like you every day,

15
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:46,600
my shop would have closed down long ago.

16
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:47,960
How about this?

17
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:49,480
I'll leave this here

18
00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:50,600
and go back to get it, okay?

19
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:51,480
You're kidding.

20
00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:53,320
What's the point of leaving it here?

21
00:00:53,320 --> 00:00:55,120
You've already eaten half of it.

22
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:57,000
Call someone to bring the money.

23
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:16,400
You did this on purpose, didn't you?

24
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:18,680
I'm calling the police.

25
00:01:18,680 --> 00:01:19,760
Let them deal with you.

26
00:01:19,760 --> 00:01:20,560
Just you wait.

27
00:01:24,880 --> 00:01:25,810
I'll pay for her.

28
00:01:25,880 --> 00:01:26,440
Plus this,

29
00:01:26,440 --> 00:01:27,240
how much is it?

30
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:27,940
Eight yuan.

31
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:31,050
Keep the change.

32
00:01:32,479 --> 00:01:33,039
Um,

33
00:01:41,759 --> 00:01:42,479
thank you.

34
00:01:44,720 --> 00:01:46,400
My house is right nearby.

35
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:47,360
Come back with me,

36
00:01:47,360 --> 00:01:49,020
and I'll get the money for you.

37
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:19,360
Wait for me here for a sec.

38
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:20,760
I'll go up and get it.

39
00:02:20,760 --> 00:02:21,280
I'll be right...

40
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,079
You live here?

41
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:25,090
Then go on up.

42
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:26,079
Bye.

43
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:29,079
Aren't you going to wait for me?

44
00:02:30,079 --> 00:02:31,720
It wasn't much money anyway.

45
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:33,280
I just saw

46
00:02:33,440 --> 00:02:34,880
you weren't looking well.

47
00:02:34,880 --> 00:02:36,079
I was afraid you'd get hit by a car.

48
00:02:36,079 --> 00:02:38,410
Since you're here, hurry up and go inside.

49
00:02:39,320 --> 00:02:40,040
Thank you.

50
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:44,720
Why don't you just wait for me here?

51
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:46,770
Really, no need.

52
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:48,079
And you,

53
00:02:48,440 --> 00:02:49,600
eat less cold food.

54
00:02:53,920 --> 00:02:54,920
Here's some milk.

55
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:56,050
It's hot.

56
00:02:57,079 --> 00:02:58,610
Make sure you drink it soon.

57
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,840
Then get a good night's sleep.

58
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:03,170
You'll find that

59
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:04,160
tomorrow's sun

60
00:03:04,760 --> 00:03:06,220
is incredibly beautiful.

61
00:03:07,160 --> 00:03:07,800
Bye.

62
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:39,160
Back then, I had nothing to do

63
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:41,000
but rebel against my dad.

64
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:42,520
I took more depression pills

65
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:44,760
than I ate actual food every day.

66
00:03:45,079 --> 00:03:46,040
At that time,

67
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:48,880
you were like a

68
00:03:49,880 --> 00:03:51,480
colorful beam of light

69
00:03:52,880 --> 00:03:55,560
shining into my gloomy life.

70
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:59,760
You suddenly brought color to my world.

71
00:04:00,640 --> 00:04:01,770
I suddenly felt like

72
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:05,160
I was alive.

73
00:04:06,760 --> 00:04:07,720
So no matter what,

74
00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:08,720
thank you.

75
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:11,400
Even if it was fake,

76
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:16,360
you really gave me a beautiful dream.

77
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,440
A truly beautiful dream.

78
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:24,480
I was never acting.

79
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:26,680
Yayan,

80
00:04:28,080 --> 00:04:29,520
every moment I spent with you,

81
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:30,560
I wasn't acting.

82
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:31,720
If I were acting,

83
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:33,650
tell me what I was supposed to play.

84
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:39,000
My dad was really killed by your dad,

85
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:40,320
right?

86
00:04:41,960 --> 00:04:44,080
You swallowed up our
Song family's business,

87
00:04:44,080 --> 00:04:44,480
right?

88
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:48,560
I really lived in a basement

89
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:50,220
and scavenged through trash.

90
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:52,720
If I were acting,

91
00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:54,050
what would I be playing?

92
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:56,330
A useless

93
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:59,170
loser at everyone's mercy?

94
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:01,840
Besides, it was Shen Xi
who killed your dad,

95
00:05:01,840 --> 00:05:02,320
not me.

96
00:05:02,320 --> 00:05:03,880
Shen Xi ran him over.

97
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:07,200
Your dad ruined...

98
00:05:07,200 --> 00:05:08,440
ruined Shen Xi's life.

99
00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:09,520
Shen Xi hated him.

100
00:05:09,520 --> 00:05:10,800
I just gave her a reason

101
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:14,120
not to look back.

102
00:05:20,520 --> 00:05:22,780
Actually, the first time the name Shen Xi

103
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:24,760
came out of your mouth...

104
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:27,680
I knew your relationship

105
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:29,480
wasn't as simple as you said.

106
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:33,200
You arranged your reunion, didn't you?

107
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:35,040
Just so she could

108
00:05:36,159 --> 00:05:38,360
help you complete this so-called plan,

109
00:05:39,440 --> 00:05:40,320
right?

110
00:05:41,080 --> 00:05:42,720
Six, seven, eight.

111
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:44,880
Three, two, three, four,

112
00:05:44,880 --> 00:05:46,000
five, six.

113
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:46,480
Okay, strike a pose,

114
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:47,120
seven, eight.

115
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:49,480
Four, two, three, four.

116
00:05:51,440 --> 00:05:52,080
Mr. Jiang,

117
00:05:52,280 --> 00:05:53,740
I'm stepping out for a bit.

118
00:06:25,400 --> 00:06:26,200
Yanfei.

119
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:28,120
Song Yanfei.

120
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:36,480
Song Yanfei, come out.

121
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:45,159
Hello,

122
00:06:46,080 --> 00:06:46,800
Mr. Jiang.

123
00:06:49,640 --> 00:06:50,720
I'll be right back.

124
00:07:06,880 --> 00:07:07,760
Shen Xi.

125
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:10,960
Shen Xi sold her body

126
00:07:13,280 --> 00:07:15,040
to win the dance competition.

127
00:07:17,760 --> 00:07:18,480
But you

128
00:07:19,320 --> 00:07:20,240
used me

129
00:07:22,440 --> 00:07:23,400
to force my dad

130
00:07:23,520 --> 00:07:25,050
to break his promise to her.

131
00:07:25,080 --> 00:07:26,610
Yayan, what brings you here

132
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:27,360
so suddenly?

133
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:29,890
Do you have an appointment
with our chairman?

134
00:07:30,640 --> 00:07:31,680
Go let him know.

135
00:07:32,440 --> 00:07:34,770
Don't interrupt your Mr. Gao's business.

136
00:07:35,159 --> 00:07:36,560
Is that Yanyan?

137
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:38,320
Come in.

138
00:07:45,840 --> 00:07:47,440
You seem quite leisurely.

139
00:07:48,320 --> 00:07:49,920
You seem pretty free yourself.

140
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:50,580
Have a seat.

141
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:04,840
Yanyan,

142
00:08:05,640 --> 00:08:06,800
what can I do for you?

143
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:09,200
Let me make this clear first.

144
00:08:09,200 --> 00:08:11,200
If it's about Song Yanfei,

145
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:13,200
save your breath.

146
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:14,600
I won't agree to it.

147
00:08:16,080 --> 00:08:17,140
Are you organizing

148
00:08:17,320 --> 00:08:19,380
that dance competition thing again?

149
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:27,080
Yanyan,

150
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:29,240
why the sudden interest

151
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:30,700
in the dance competition?

152
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,039
That's great.

153
00:08:39,919 --> 00:08:40,640
Back then,

154
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:43,000
I didn't let you learn dance,

155
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:44,840
which caused you to fall downstairs

156
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:45,480
and injure your ankle...

157
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:46,940
Let's not talk about this.

158
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:52,320
I've always felt so guilty.

159
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:55,500
So I've been sponsoring
this dance competition

160
00:08:55,880 --> 00:08:57,210
just to make it up to you.

161
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:58,880
A few years ago,

162
00:08:59,120 --> 00:09:00,520
I asked you to manage it,

163
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:02,000
but you refused.

164
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:03,640
What?

165
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:05,650
Are you interested now?

166
00:09:06,680 --> 00:09:07,160
Tell you

167
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:09,080
what, just tell me

168
00:09:09,400 --> 00:09:10,200
what you want.

169
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:12,250
Dad will agree to anything.

170
00:09:13,400 --> 00:09:14,040
There's a contestant

171
00:09:14,040 --> 00:09:15,240
named Shen Xi, right?

172
00:09:17,040 --> 00:09:17,720
Why are you

173
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:19,960
interested in the contestants?

174
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:22,360
I heard she's doing well,

175
00:09:22,560 --> 00:09:23,690
but I don't like her.

176
00:09:23,920 --> 00:09:25,080
She can't be placed.

177
00:09:34,640 --> 00:09:35,800
Do you know her?

178
00:09:36,160 --> 00:09:37,960
Do you have a grudge against her?

179
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:39,330
Don't worry about that.

180
00:09:40,160 --> 00:09:41,320
Didn't you just say

181
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:42,720
you'd agree to anything?

182
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:44,000
This is my request.

183
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:49,000
You just

184
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:51,280
don't want her to win
the championship, right?

185
00:09:51,280 --> 00:09:52,880
An excellence award at most.

186
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:54,920
No top three.

187
00:09:55,800 --> 00:09:56,600
Take them off.

188
00:09:57,200 --> 00:09:58,200
Leave nothing on.

189
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:33,460
Open your eyes.

190
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:37,000
Look at me.

191
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:40,840
Look at me.

192
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:01,680
Yanyan,

193
00:11:02,760 --> 00:11:04,280
this girl Shen Xi

194
00:11:04,280 --> 00:11:05,680
dances very well.

195
00:11:05,920 --> 00:11:07,650
She's championship material.

196
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:08,560
I was thinking...

197
00:11:08,560 --> 00:11:09,290
I promise you

198
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:11,120
I'll meet Feng Shu

199
00:11:11,280 --> 00:11:12,680
and try to get to know him.

200
00:11:12,800 --> 00:11:13,560
Is that okay?

201
00:11:15,440 --> 00:11:16,520
But let me be clear.

202
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:18,200
If I don't like him,

203
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:19,240
you can't force me.

204
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:20,480
I'm only promising to try

205
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:22,240
and get to know him.

206
00:11:27,760 --> 00:11:28,280
Deal.

207
00:11:30,040 --> 00:11:30,500
I'm off.

208
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:35,440
Can't I know

209
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:37,880
why you're targeting Shen Xi?

210
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:56,440
How is it?

211
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:57,480
Does it look good?

212
00:12:01,040 --> 00:12:02,120
It looks really good.

213
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:03,650
Better than the nail salon.

214
00:12:03,680 --> 00:12:06,040
That's a bit of a stretch.

215
00:12:06,040 --> 00:12:07,840
I just put on a random color.

216
00:12:07,880 --> 00:12:09,680
They are way more professional.

217
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:11,130
They have bad taste.

218
00:12:11,480 --> 00:12:13,080
Your taste is so much better.

219
00:12:14,160 --> 00:12:15,320
Smooth talker.

220
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:19,900
By the way, Yanyan,

221
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:22,520
did you tell

222
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:23,800
your dad

223
00:12:24,440 --> 00:12:25,500
what I asked you to?

224
00:12:26,040 --> 00:12:26,840
Tell him what?

225
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:29,120
About Shen Xi dancing.

226
00:12:30,200 --> 00:12:31,660
The final is in three days.

227
00:12:31,840 --> 00:12:33,300
We're running out of time.

228
00:12:37,120 --> 00:12:38,880
Yanfei, tell me the truth.

229
00:12:40,560 --> 00:12:42,400
Why are you targeting Shen Xi

230
00:12:42,800 --> 00:12:44,800
and trying to stop her from placing?

231
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:48,560
For you.

232
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:49,920
For me?

233
00:12:51,320 --> 00:12:51,720
No,

234
00:12:52,040 --> 00:12:53,960
don't think I'm that petty.

235
00:12:54,040 --> 00:12:55,400
I really don't mind
that you two have a past.

236
00:12:55,400 --> 00:12:56,000
And I think

237
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:57,240
she truly deserves to win

238
00:12:57,240 --> 00:12:58,440
this championship. I know.

239
00:12:58,440 --> 00:12:58,880
Yanyan,

240
00:12:58,880 --> 00:12:59,480
I know.

241
00:13:00,160 --> 00:13:02,160
It's true
that we broke up a long time ago.

242
00:13:02,160 --> 00:13:02,800
And she's

243
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:05,160
always known about our relationship.

244
00:13:05,160 --> 00:13:06,720
But she just won't give up,

245
00:13:07,440 --> 00:13:09,500
whether it's on me or the dance drama.

246
00:13:10,200 --> 00:13:11,000
She just wants

247
00:13:11,480 --> 00:13:13,810
to win that 300,000 prize money this time,

248
00:13:14,360 --> 00:13:15,420
so she can come back

249
00:13:15,880 --> 00:13:18,280
and invest in my dance drama
after winning.

250
00:13:21,560 --> 00:13:22,240
But

251
00:13:22,880 --> 00:13:24,210
think about it this way.

252
00:13:24,720 --> 00:13:26,080
Even though we're together now

253
00:13:26,080 --> 00:13:27,160
and you don't lack this money,

254
00:13:27,160 --> 00:13:27,690
the money

255
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:30,160
she won is Gao Yuhai's.

256
00:13:30,720 --> 00:13:31,400
It'd be a waste

257
00:13:31,400 --> 00:13:33,000
not to take his money, right?

258
00:13:36,240 --> 00:13:37,040
That's true.

259
00:13:38,160 --> 00:13:40,080
Then I'll let her take the prize money

260
00:13:40,080 --> 00:13:41,480
and continue investing in the dance drama,

261
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:42,760
and let her dance the lead role again.

262
00:13:42,760 --> 00:13:43,520
That way,

263
00:13:43,520 --> 00:13:44,120
it seems we'll be

264
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:46,120
entangled for the rest of our lives.

265
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:47,800
What?

266
00:13:49,400 --> 00:13:50,560
Don't you dare!

267
00:13:50,560 --> 00:13:51,480
Song Yanfei,

268
00:13:51,480 --> 00:13:53,240
h-how could you think like that?

269
00:13:53,240 --> 00:13:54,240
So,

270
00:13:55,720 --> 00:13:58,120
what I mean is to make
a clean break with her.

271
00:14:01,760 --> 00:14:02,220
Yanyan,

272
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:05,850
I just want to tell her directly

273
00:14:06,080 --> 00:14:07,080
not to worry about

274
00:14:07,200 --> 00:14:08,200
this dance drama,

275
00:14:09,240 --> 00:14:10,500
because I have you now.

276
00:14:16,720 --> 00:14:17,280
Be good.

277
00:14:23,400 --> 00:14:24,600
Not just the ranking.

278
00:14:24,800 --> 00:14:26,760
You can't give her the prize money either.

279
00:14:26,760 --> 00:14:29,360
If I find out
you're secretly giving her money,

280
00:14:29,480 --> 00:14:30,960
I'll disown you.

281
00:14:33,520 --> 00:14:34,320
You know me.

282
00:14:34,320 --> 00:14:35,240
I keep my word.

283
00:14:36,400 --> 00:14:38,720
Even the excellence award
comes with a few thousand.

284
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:39,960
That doesn't matter.

285
00:14:52,960 --> 00:14:53,560
You used me

286
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:57,040
and forced my dad

287
00:14:57,160 --> 00:14:58,690
to break his promise to her,

288
00:14:59,080 --> 00:15:00,880
just to fuel her hatred,

289
00:15:01,720 --> 00:15:03,240
turn her into your tool for revenge,

290
00:15:03,240 --> 00:15:04,040
and use her as your weapon

291
00:15:04,040 --> 00:15:05,480
to kill for you, right?

292
00:15:11,720 --> 00:15:13,240
If it weren't for Shen Xi's last words,

293
00:15:13,240 --> 00:15:14,920
I might never have known

294
00:15:16,480 --> 00:15:18,320
